      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name}: i wonder if your android upload just failed. In which case it will stay on that platform and not return (and maybe there is a bug of some kind that forces you to clear the MPB state?).\n\nI'll test a couple scenarios, but unless I'll be able to get a working recreation of the bug I'm afraid we won't be able to do much.\n\nThanks for the info tho!",
